  "question": {
    "text": "If the area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>y</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>256</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "36",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Plotting the diagram of given data we have,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0082_56187248ff6e.png\" style=\"width: 210px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p>Now finding limit by diagram, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#177;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>So total area will be given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mn>0</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>Now for solving&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p>&nbsp;Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msup><mo>&#183;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>Now putting the limit and solving we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>64</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>16</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>36</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>256</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>256</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></math></p>"
  }
